		{
			dependencies: ["694D21DD359391F9"]
			description: [
				"Once you unlock steam, it might be a good idea to invest in the &6large steam multis&r. They are much faster than the single block counterparts, up until ~HV (depending on what you want to do)."
				""
				"The only caveat is that you need to actually &omake&r steam fast enough. Check out the &6large steam boilers&r for this task."
				""
				"All of the large steam multis use 64mb/t of steam"
